== b04_nestedscoped
  san:    exit 134 use after scope closed: storage a closed scope gave back was read or written|
  O3:     exit 0 nested 12|nested 50|
  interp: exit 1 olang interpret: b04_nestedscoped.olang:32: it uses storage after the scope it was made in closed|
--- compile (-debug -sanitize)
built ./build/b04_nestedscoped.debug.san
--- run san
use after scope closed: storage a closed scope gave back was read or written
--- run O3
nested 12
nested 50
--- interpret
olang interpret: b04_nestedscoped.olang:32: it uses storage after the scope it was made in closed
